5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We must stop the bleeding. Last year’s deficit is still on our books.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. But we also need to ensure no one burns out again.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Budget is vital, but so is who actually shows up. Attendance is key.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about the physical toll. Sleep quality affects performance.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The flat fee hides individual costs. We need to audit the side spending.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Minako, attendance data will show if the location drives people away.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, correct. But we must also check the duty roster burden.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,I will look at the attendance sheets and the seniors' comments.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I need to know the actual sleeping conditions. I will check the hall timetable.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I will review the group transport receipts and the prefecture rate sheet.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will examine the accounts from the two clubs that went inland.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will check the canteen closure and the last year's cooking duty.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Toshio, that sounds heavy. I hope the data is clear.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Asuka, the rate sheet might reveal hidden costs for public beds.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,Yes. I will also look into the lottery for public group bookings.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,We need hard numbers before we commit to any destination.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. Let us see what the records say about the workload.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minako,,I will focus on the social dynamics. Who talks to whom?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will focus on the quiet hours. Peace is essential for recovery.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will focus on the financial leakage. Every yen must be accounted for.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
