35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The inland accounts show eight to a room. That is a cost saver, but is it viable?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, eight to a room is a nightmare for sleep. I found the canteen closes.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minako,,I found that attendance drops when we stay in separate blocks. Cohesion dies.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I found the hall is booked by others. We cannot get a quiet, continuous block.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The public beds are cheap, but the application is a bureaucratic trap.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, if the application fails, we are stuck with expensive private rooms.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Minako, cohesion is good, but if the kitchen is closed, we cook. That kills cohesion.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Toshio, cooking together is part of the bonding. But only if we are together.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"If we are split, the sleep suffers. I need a place where we can rest.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"The flat fee for public beds is low, but the risk of losing the lottery is high.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The inland option is cheap but crowded. The public option is cheap but risky.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The private option is expensive but controlled. I prefer control over chaos.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minako,,I prefer the option that forces us to be together. Separation is the enemy.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,I prefer the option that guarantees quiet. Noise is the enemy of recovery.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,I prefer the option with the lowest financial risk. Uncertainty is the enemy of fairness.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,We need to weigh the cost against the risk of failure.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,We need to weigh the cost against the risk of burnout.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minako,,We need to weigh the cost against the risk of disintegration.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,We need to weigh the cost against the risk of exhaustion.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,We need to weigh the cost against the risk of inequity.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
